\newlabel{fig:stg}{{1}{4}{Left: the dual-granularity temporal dynamics module (DG-TDM), composed of the MoDeA branch (motion deformation attention) and the TSA branch (temporal state aggregation). Right: the STG block with bilateral window cross-attention, adaptive fusion, and gated refinement}{figure.1}{}}
