\citation{dvt2022}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Overall framework of DG-TDM. A frozen CLIP encoder extracts spatial priors from each frame; the spatial-temporal guidance (STG) branch injects these priors into a temporal action encoder through bilateral window cross-attention and adaptive gating. Inside each temporal stage, the dual-granularity temporal dynamics module (DG-TDM) refines the feature with a motion deformation attention (MoDeA) branch and a temporal state aggregation (TSA) branch.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{2}{6}{Overall framework of \dgtdm . A frozen CLIP encoder extracts spatial priors from each frame; the spatial-temporal guidance (STG) branch injects these priors into a temporal action encoder through bilateral window cross-attention and adaptive gating. Inside each temporal stage, the dual-granularity temporal dynamics module (DG-TDM) refines the feature with a motion deformation attention (MoDeA) branch and a temporal state aggregation (TSA) branch}{figure.2}{}}
